1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,375
Ligands can be ranked by how strongly they split the d orbitals.

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:06,901
This is the spectrochemical series.

3
00:00:06,901 --> 00:00:13,111
Iodide, bromide, chloride and fluoride are weak: small splitting, high spin.

4
00:00:13,111 --> 00:00:18,450
Then hydroxide, water, ammonia, ethane diamine, nitrite.

5
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:24,388
Cyanide and carbon monoxide are the strongest: large splitting, low spin.

